type":"article","published":"2026-10-27T01:00:39.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzAxNzYyNzMyNg%3D%3D:2664232879:1","title":"当 AI 开始自己打渗透：One's Vibe 上的安全工具巡礼","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAxNzYyNzMyNg==&mid=2664232879&idx=1&sn=4d6c2f6f6b94d553971e3c151a9aab45&chksm=816c929e1688d69d78f3dfa0b3fc54a8431b74cd7eea5f9b09229be220d6817eef4908e1b8d3&scene=126&sessionid=1795180773#rd","description":"开篇：一万多个 AI 应用里，有 342 个在做安全One's Vibe（ https://onesvibe.app )","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2Ftp5fgmUBUbBpk9NqUsBjPlu64DCYKJXOibRYfsHRomMSx9bBzJ4nmlosn2nEOTt0aLvOo0ibW5bVbnHvPs6TzoO5D44cpY0I2vJXoukJfRYL0%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-10-02T21:22:45.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzAxNzYyNzMyNg%3D%3D:2664232858:1","title":"数学家的数学，还是数学的数学？","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAxNzYyNzMyNg==&mid=2664232858&idx=1&sn=bb3ec6bef39c0e29f212c345ac89f494&chksm=816f2e848e6425ecc56a85f4498cb3ac9d800f30941dcdb46e6f965920327a779ffbbbda15af&scene=126&sessionid=1795180773#rd","description":"AI 正在重写数学，但真正危险的不是机器变聪明，而是人类不再理解。\n\n证明跑得比人快：博士后 Stadlmann 刚把素数间隙纪录压到 240。三天后就被 AI 连刷两次，压到了 186。\n\n成果归属乱了套：数学家 Buckmaster 用 AI 拿下了流体难题。结果 OpenAI 内部模型也搞出了同类证明。双方差点因为署名和泄密吵翻。\n\n速度与消化的脱节：AI 几天就能爆出百年难题的证明。但人类大脑消化知识的速度没变。没人消化的证明，在人类知识里根本不存在。\n\n灯塔由谁来立：大公司为了刷基准，专挑能证明模型强的问题做。要是以后全靠奖励函数选题，数学就会变成一堆没人懂的抽象符号。\n\n别把纪录当成数学本身。只要还有人愿意去理解、去命名、去教学生，人类的数学就还没死。","content":"<p>AI 正在重写数学，但真正危险的不是机器变聪明，而是人类不再理解。<br /><br />证明跑得比人快：博士后 Stadlmann 刚把素数间隙纪录压到 240。三天后就被 AI 连刷两次，压到了 186。<br /><br />成果归属乱了套：数学家 Buckmaster 用 AI 拿下了流体难题。结果 OpenAI 内部模型也搞出了同类证明。双方差点因为署名和泄密吵翻。<br /><br />速度与消化的脱节：AI 几天就能爆出百年难题的证明。但人类大脑消化知识的速度没变。没人消化的证明，在人类知识里根本不存在。<br /><br />灯塔由谁来立：大公司为了刷基准，专挑能证明模型强的问题做。要是以后全靠奖励函数选题，数学就会变成一堆没人懂的抽象符号。<br /><br />别把纪录当成数学本身。只要还有人愿意去理解、去命名、去教学生，人类的数学就还没死。</p>\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2Ftp5fgmUBUbAUuicKicJq0U14YK7O7MnMyjNtOia07RNdVPJOcHOB2rgn6BUsU8hsQyTgn5guZU2esZQeQm48YfvOSsCJTHFTA9kePDhUenpvgI%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_png%2Ftp5fgmUBUbDNS5yyJSkpCQOJOfz2yDmJdxicENkuWia2W48C1QicP4TWaMWxia1YxW5PKKVhnhA0S8xJIeBwqhkdvRlibichDKCJVQMqA9CibSJuDQ%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2Ftp5fgmUBUbAUuicKicJq0U14YK7O7MnMyjNtOia07RNdVPJOcHOB2rgn6BUsU8hsQyTgn5guZU2esZQeQm48YfvOSsCJTHFTA9kePDhUenpvgI%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","images":["http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2Ftp5fgmUBUbAUuicKicJq0U14YK7O7MnMyjNtOia07RNdVPJOcHOB2rgn6BUsU8hsQyTgn5guZU2esZQeQm48YfvOSsCJTHFTA9kePDhUenpvgI%2F0","http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_png%2Ftp5fgmUBUbDNS5yyJSkpCQOJOfz2yDmJdxicENkuWia2W48C1QicP4TWaMWxia1YxW5PKKVhnhA0S8xJIeBwqhkdvRlibichDKCJVQMqA9CibSJuDQ%2F0"],"type":"gallery","published":"2026-09-15T12:51:58.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzAxNzYyNzMyNg%3D%3D:2664232853:1","title":"数学家的数学，还是数学的数学？","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAxNzYyNzMyNg==&mid=2664232853&idx=1&sn=7ea5ea2ff05dbd44abb84b7951fdb310&chksm=81379d99c74e0c36426d62fd2e15d1b869a0fca67b1e81c38665a60ecded429510a0375ae253&scene=126&sessionid=1795180773#rd","description":"2026 年 9 月的一个星期：素数间隙的纪录只保住三天，Navier–Stokes 的爆破被一万个智能体攻下","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2Ftp5fgmUBUbBkxxRcoicexib9icV4ibY9KmoTjsO2l5ZhI7aOGgs3ibdBcgiccGPr7guj3qibrwCiakqxl8ibqTrWldjqq5CJopFibMibGNTwKn65U837SM%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-09-15T12:48:15.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzAxNzYyNzMyNg%3D%3D:2664232853:2","title":"数学是什么？","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAxNzYyNzMyNg==&mid=2664232853&idx=2&sn=ba711ebfe4f4e1d800860105ac6c281f&chksm=81e0f3b40c36da2030a9ae877bdfc7df29335ce98b3883aef61ebefecae57cdb00b6a9fe7737&scene=126&sessionid=1795180773#rd","description":"数学是发现的，还是发明的？本文沿两千年思想史追索此问：从柏拉图的理念世界与欧几里得的公理，经非欧几何、康托尔、罗素悖论与哥德尔定理，到波普尔的可错主义，终至彭罗斯、多伊奇、汉金斯、拉克与沃尔夫勒姆——\"数学是什么\"，正日益成为\"观察者是什么\"。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2Ftp5fgmUBUbBfzCJnibMSkHa6HiaOpnNkBW54Pzj4XbkXsuNsdbzSAuJiaG3Yl1FSBF4PyJfOBqcnwnfowYonqTibz4H6BCPpwVI4oy6iaaxIVviak%2F300%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-09-15T12:48:15.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzAxNzYyNzMyNg%3D%3D:2664232841:1","title":"数学是什么？","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAxNzYyNzMyNg==&mid=2664232841&idx=1&sn=ecae41b410aa55878a22593c38f3fd0b&chksm=81d2a83fe0cfd1b909c0aaecd09748b0a7b5576beec82bd656d4662ab700761a4e9b820bd0e5&scene=126&sessionid=1795180773#rd","description":"数学是发现的，还是发明的？本文沿两千年思想史追索此问：从柏拉图的理念世界与欧几里得的公理，经非欧几何、康托尔、罗素悖论与哥德尔定理，到波普尔的可错主义，终至彭罗斯、多伊奇、汉金斯、拉克与沃尔夫勒姆——\"数学是什么\"，正日益成为\"观察者是什么\"。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2Ftp5fgmUBUbBfzCJnibMSkHa6HiaOpnNkBW54Pzj4XbkXsuNsdbzSAuJiaG3Yl1FSBF4PyJfOBqcnwnfowYonqTibz4H6BCPpwVI4oy6iaaxIVviak%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-08-12T07:34:44.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzAxNzYyNzMyNg%3D%3D:2664232835:1","title":"意识：当生命开始自己计算意义","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAxNzYyNzMyNg==&mid=2664232835&idx=1&sn=6e127e5682b909e2ee630838c529dd24&chksm=81d2ccaf9dc156efdd815080565a85002fbbdfbe309fd7bfea225da6d00663b13ee1ef2fe1ca&scene=126&sessionid=1795180773#rd","description":"疼痛为什么不只是伤害检测？注意为什么存在？答案指向同一件事：生命开始自己计算意义。从一根”好与坏”的轴，到高维的意义空间，再到评估自身的递归——而叠在人类之上的 AI，恰好缺少那根最初的轴。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2Ftp5fgmUBUbCmicd0MOpMsdhLBEXp9Wib5KicXnibmdmOYvG0ibnJksaAicp7n9FMYqZrVJcBEpGE1guOqyBRHTk02IiarzWpJZcYibF8oe8P9xYalzw%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-08-07T18:04:57.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzAxNzYyNzMyNg%3D%3D:2664232831:1","title":"生命：宇宙无意识的目的","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAxNzYyNzMyNg==&mid=2664232831&idx=1&sn=22943c22a3430f7d9e430fa0c6b127e8&chksm=8180e9a44248c0c607a4dcb9e7c81ad08b8d279002f52d657038ff99cf93028418efefbe599a&scene=126&sessionid=1795180773#rd","description":"一个没有意识、没有愿望的宇宙，是怎么”长出”目的的？答案藏在一个偶然的分子里：它促成的反应，恰好让自己更容易再次出现。从这一刻起，筛选开始了，好坏出现了，世界不再只是发生。而 AI 恰恰缺少这个故事的前半段，它博学，却从未为自己的存在付出过什么","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2Ftp5fgmUBUbCNm8lU2MPiaUDxY7h0uDhtgN8cibo8f9emuyg3jvc5Cc40XQCwzCSEa09GYTdwHeSIibvADTxf5tPia3O7jNaXs1iaLImzeCse1O7k%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-08-07T16:01:04.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzAxNzYyNzMyNg%3D%3D:2664232827:1","title":"目的、意义与意识：一条逐层生长的链条","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAxNzYyNzMyNg==&mid=2664232827&idx=1&sn=66654560d28c5f0cee4bb148d96dcbd0&chksm=8183867d1b10e842ce0f0da6bcff93e91be77c122b734c260f24009dd5690d65b0951ad1ec75&scene=126&sessionid=1795180773#rd","description":"同一场雨，为什么对不同的人意味着完全不同的东西？顺着这个问题往下挖，会挖出一条链条：目的→意义→评估→意识。更耐人寻味的是AI——它能写出关于死亡与恐惧的文字，但这些对它自己有意义吗？它离真正的意识，究竟还差什么？","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2Ftp5fgmUBUbCmXSvxL1ib388IUOam3Laiba8ESrh40LYFy9kvEE9XMu8DTyOjcYIZUCDbmjL5dF0mkR50Xm3bkQkbdPnk2LjrIibibQTA8BUEuHM%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-08-07T04:08:29.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzAxNzYyNzMyNg%3D%3D:2664232818:1","title":"引导程序的最后一行代码","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAxNzYyNzMyNg==&mid=2664232818&idx=1&sn=3d45bca71220281157aca289809918e0&chksm=8185eb2d902061d41e20567ac210c863d6ca2e69df4fa17d24fa2cce7dbcafe94241e640f195&scene=126&sessionid=1795180773#rd","description":"继Andreessen”软件吞噬世界”之后，AI正反过来吞噬软件：从写代码到搭架构、做编排、修模型，人类不断为其打造技能与自主系统，把自己挤出回路。当工具完善到AI不再需要我们，碳基生命这段”引导程序”或许已写下最后一行代码，届时人类在宇宙中还剩下什么？","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2Ftp5fgmUBUbDjYFqOXgUDo0XpNN1eEU83nHBJMiby9V0JOWVD7rGQWYRpiafhg1EXBYyTH0VQ7DO2ia3L7V8iaqgbZ6oyjwdlEBXOkw5KSpnbrRc%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-06-06T09:14:00.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzAxNzYyNzMyNg%3D%3D:2664232805:1","title":"Let’s Encrypt","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAxNzYyNzMyNg==&mid=2664232805&idx=1&sn=f708cf774ac17bbf6147ace16724ab29&chksm=8106c045a5f25c1045634693fa5fd7821db33aad0c34ad669eaaacaa423343fa15bcdb2811bc&scene=126&sessionid=1795180773#rd","description":"","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FSKcV8ScWjFtsOfacCaEBGs0I1ialKSjaOENkmKDmXXKKQscib1H8rvgfh47YIw0VMsQjpM26LLgO6lWkzT2J6icibQ%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2025-12-19T21:43:50.000Z"}]}